# Example CODEOWNERS for EngineeringSpec adopters.
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @your-team with real owners.
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch ruleset, or these entries block nothing.
# `engineeringspec doctor` warns when any of these paths has no owner.

# Contracts that authorize file scope, and their closure receipts
/docs/engineering-specs/ @your-team

# CI wiring that runs the gate; a pull request runs its own copy of this workflow
/.github/workflows/ @your-team

# The ownership map itself
/.github/CODEOWNERS @your-team

# Adoption mode, repository policy, and selector configuration
/engineering-spec.json @your-team
